  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><p>ANSI's (Areas of Natural and Scientific Interest) are polygon features that represent lands and waters containing important natural landscapes or features that are important for natural heritage, protection, appreciation, scientific study or education.<br />&nbsp;</p></div><div>This class has related tables. <a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets?q=RT_ANSI' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Areas of Natural and Scientific Interest (ANSI) related tables</a><br />&nbsp;</div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/ANSI%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>ANSI Data Description (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/ANSI%20-%20Documentation.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>ANSI Documentation (Word)</a></li></ul></div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Status</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div>On going: Data is continually being updated<br />&nbsp;</div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div>As needed: Data is updated as deemed necessary&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</div><div><br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Contact</strong><br />&nbsp;</div><div>Natural Heritage Section, Fish and Wildlife Policy Branch, Policy Division, <a href='mailto:naturalheritage@ontario.ca' rel='nofollow ugc'>naturalheritage@ontario.ca</a> &nbsp;</div>"
